 "name_en": "Make-to-Order Production – Process Manufacturing (3OK)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Make-to-Order Production – Process Manufacturing (3OK)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio7376b40b24d5495f997c415b77559f2b\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio7376b40b24d5495f997c415b77559f2b__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">The standard sales process (make-to-order) for batch-managed finished goods starts with a customer quotation or sales order and ends with the clearing of a customer account after a payment is received.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">The process starts with the creation of a quotation and then a sales order that references it, or by creating a sales order directly.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">The production process based on process orders is triggered by a material requirement planning (MRP) run for the product ordered by the customer and all its components. Once the finished product with a batch is in stock, the delivery and billing of the goods completes the process.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">The process can be enhanced by executing optional steps, such as procurement of components or period-end closing.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio7376b40b24d5495f997c415b77559f2b__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create quotation for customer</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create referenced sales order from the quotation</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Plan and execute the production process with process orders</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Deliver the produced goods</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Bill customer based on billing plan from sales order</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio7376b40b24d5495f997c415b77559f2b__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Plan production in a make-to-order scenario based on customer sales order</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Drive production of customer requirements using process orders</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>按订单生产 – 流程制造 (3OK)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio7376b40b24d5495f997c415b77559f2b\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio7376b40b24d5495f997c415b77559f2b__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">批次管理成品的标准销售流程（按订单生产）从客户报价或销售订单开始，到收到付款后清算客户科目结束。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">此流程首先创建报价，然后创建参考报价的销售订单，或直接创建销售订单。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">基于流程订单的生产流程由客户及其所有组件订购的产品的物料需求计划 (MRP) 运行触发。当有批次的成品有库存后，货物的交货和开票即完成此流程。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">可通过执行可选步骤（如组件采购或期末关账）增强流程。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio7376b40b24d5495f997c415b77559f2b__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">为客户创建报价</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">根据报价创建参考销售订单</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">使用流程订单计划和执行生产流程</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">交付生产的货物</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">基于销售订单中的开票计划向客户开票</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio7376b40b24d5495f997c415b77559f2b__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">基于客户销售订单，计划按订单生产场景中的生产</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">使用流程订单推动客户需求的生产</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
